# closure Broiler.VM.Composition.JavaScript.ExecutionOnly rid=linux-x64
#
# Violates I3 (since SJL-7.4): a closure listing of the execution-only root, which declares no Intl
# surface, that holds the Unicode area's optional segmentation package, Broiler.Unicode.Segmentation.
# JSD-0074's X5 says segmentation is carried only by the roots whose closure carries the Intl data
# assembly; this listing carries the package without that assembly. Read by rule I3 as a closure
# listing is.

Broiler.ECMAScript.Algorithms
Broiler.Unicode.Algorithms
Broiler.Unicode.Segmentation
